# Deep Rock Mining Co. Ltd — environment reference
# Copy to `.env.local` for local development as needed. None of these are
# required to run the site; they only configure production SEO behaviour.

# Canonical production origin (used by metadataBase, canonicals, Open Graph,
# sitemap.xml and robots.txt). Defaults to https://deeprockminingh.com in
# lib/seo/site-config.ts.
# IMPORTANT: set this ONLY in the production environment on Vercel. Preview /
# staging deployments must NOT inherit it, or they would emit preview URLs in
# canonicals and the sitemap.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://deeprockminingh.com

# Google Search Console verification token.
# How to obtain it:
#   1. https://search.google.com/search-console → "Add property" → "URL prefix"
#      → enter https://deeprockminingh.com (or add the full domain property).
#   2. Choose the "HTML tag" verification method — Google shows a meta tag like
#      <meta name="google-site-verification" content="xxxxxxxx" />.
#   3. Copy the content value (xxxxxxxx) and set it here.
# For local testing put it in `.env.local`; for production add it as a Vercel
# environment variable (Production scope). No verification tag is emitted until
# this variable is set — the wiring already exists in app/layout.tsx.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=
